  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU Support to ECOWAS in Peace, Security and Governance (EPSG)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;The Action aims &lt;/span&gt;&lt;em style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;to &lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;enhance peace, security and governance in the ECOWAS region by:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;1. Strengthening conflict prevention, crisis management and peace mediation based on ECOWAS&#xbf; early warning and response mechanisms in the region.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;2. Enhancing ECOWAS&#xbf; role in promoting a secure, democratic and human rights-based environment &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;3. Promoting transparent, peaceful and democratic national electoral processes and dialogues across ECOWAS member states &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;4. Enhancing the implementation of the peace and security agenda for women and youth within ECOWAS and across targeted member states.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
